# ── Generated SDK stubs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated stubs for SDKs that ship as their own package (PHP,
# Python, TypeScript) ARE committed so `composer require`, `pip install`,
# and `npm install` work without buf/protoc installed on the consumer side.
# Go / C# regenerate through their respective package-manager workflows.
sdk/csharp/Generated/

# ── Docs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore generated docs EXCEPT the committed, CI-drift-checked Phase 0A artifacts.
docs/generated/*
!docs/generated/udb-native-contract.json
!docs/generated/authn-authz-rpc-inventory.md
!docs/generated/authn-authz-sensitive-fields.md
!docs/generated/codebase-map.md
!docs/generated/http-api-style-exceptions.json
!docs/generated/http-api-style-exceptions.md
# Phase 3: committed contract baseline (breaking-change gate) + descriptor-generated native-service docs.
!docs/generated/contract-baseline.bin
!docs/generated/consistency-golden.json
!docs/generated/native-services.md
docs/upgrade_todo.md

